---
kind: scene
id: mid.giantWakes
title: The sleeping giant
on: enterRoute
target: route.r12
priority: 20
when: "holds(hasItem(wakingFlute))"
---

// Slumbear, asleep across Route 12 since anyone can remember. East's
// wakingFlute (Elder Rook, Ash Tower) opens gate sleepingGiant; walking onto
// the lakeshore with it plays the scripted encounter once per run. The quest
// midSleepingGiant (quests/mid/side-quests.lute) judges how it ends: caught,
// or let go.

## The wall of fur

::bg{location="route-12" time="day"}
::music{action="fadeOut"}
@narrator: The road along Lake Hush ends in a wall of fur. It rises. It falls. It snores, and the reeds bend with every breath.
@narrator: The flute from Ash Tower is warm in your bag, as if it knows.

## The flute

::sfx{sound="waking-flute"}
@narrator: You play the flute. One clear note goes out over the water, and Lake Hush holds it for a long time.
::camera{shake="0.6" duration="1.2"}
@narrator: The wall of fur stops snoring. An eye opens, as big as a cartwheel, and looks straight at you.
::accept{quest="midSleepingGiant"}
::music{action="change" mood="battle" volume="up"}
@narrator: Slumbear gets up. It is not happy about it.
::encounter{species="slumbear" level="40"}
